      ],
      "content": "SP 90 NW                   CHARTRIDGE           BELLINGDON                                                 (West Side) 2/11                                            Bloomfield Farmhouse - GV                                              II House.  C17 altered.  Timber frame with red brick infill.  Old tile roof, central chimney.  2-storeys.  Modern gabled porch, three modern leaded windows to ground floor, four to first floor.  Timber framing renewed or covered in modern planks.  East gable wall facing road has original timber framing also visible in rear (north) elevation which has a projecting chimney stack at each end. RCHM I p 98 MON 31. Listing NGR: SP9438405128"
    }
